  "description": "A mirror of New York City's 2017 high-resolution land cover map, maintained by [BetaNYC](https://beta.nyc). The NYC Office of Technology and Innovation publishes the map on [NYC Open Data](https://data.cityofnewyork.us/d/he6d-2qns) as a zipped ERDAS Imagine file. This catalog carries it as a Cloud Optimized GeoTIFF that clients can read in place. Read the [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) before you query it.",
